* {{cite book |title= Modern Lexicography|last= Béjoint|first= Henri |year= 2000|publisher= Oxford University Press|location= |isbn= 0-19-829951-6|page= |pages= |url=https://archive.org/details/modernlexicograp0000bejo|accessdate=|quote= }}
