* {{cite book|title=Lexicography at a Crossroads: Dictionaries and Encyclopedias Today, Lexicographical Tools Tomorrow|editor1=Bergenholtz, H. |editor2=Nielsen, S. |editor3=Tarp, S. |publisher=Peter Lang|year=2009|isbn=978-3-03911-799-4}}
