t17=Ming |last18=Hu |first18=Dongsheng |last19=Hu |first19=Fulan |title=Fried-food consumption and risk of overweight/Obesity, type 2 diabetes mellitus, and hypertension in adults: A meta-analysis of observational studies |url=https://www.tandfonline.com/action/cookieAbsent|access-date=2026-05-14|journal=Critical Reviews in Food Science and Nutrition|date=2022 |volume=62 |issue=24 |pages=6809–6820 |doi=10.1080/10408398.2021.1906626 |pmid=33825582 }}</ref>

